The prune window must be at least timeout_seconds + 60: 359 is one second short of
300 + 60.
-- dynaflux.yaml --
store: analytics
regions: [us-east-1, us-west-2]
runtime:
  timeout_seconds: 300
  prune_window_seconds: 359
-- dynaflux/page_views.sql --
CREATE STREAM page_views (
    user_id     String,
    page        String,
    referrer    Nullable(String),
    tags        Array(String),
    duration_ms UInt32
)
PRIMARY KEY (user_id);
-- want --
dynaflux.yaml:5:25: error DF6305
-- want-text --
dynaflux.yaml:5:25: error DF6305: runtime.prune_window_seconds is 359, less than runtime.timeout_seconds + 60 = 360: the projector could drop a high-water mark that a running invocation still needs, and count some events twice
  hint: set it to at least 360, or remove it to use the default, 960
